msgstr "街道上有轨电车 - 街道苜蓿叶交汇上有轨电车三角"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-584E1600"
msgid "Tram-on-Street triangle"
msgstr "街道上有轨电车三角"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-584E1700"
msgid "Diagonal Tram-on-Street with SAM cobblestone Street intersection"
msgstr "斜向街道上有轨电车与SAM鹅卵石街道交叉口"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-584E1800"
msgid "Diagonal Tram-on-Street intersection with orthogonal Road"
msgstr "斜向街道上有轨电车与正交道路交叉口"

