msgstr "街道上有轨电车交汇 - 正交与斜向"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-584E2000"
msgid ""
"Tram-on-Street transition to orthogonal and diagonal SAM cobblestone Streets - Tram turning circle\n"
"Fill street gap with Station or puzzle piece"
msgstr ""
"街道上有轨电车转换为正交和斜向SAM鹅卵石街道 - 有轨电车调头环\n"
"用车站或拼块填补街道缺口"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-584E2300"
msgid ""
"Straight Tram-on-Street - junction to diagonal SAM cobblestone Street with Tram turning circle\n"
"Fill street gap with Station or puzzle piece"
msgstr ""
"直线街道上有轨电车 - 与斜向SAM鹅卵石街道交汇并带有轨电车调头环\n"
"用车站或拼块填补街道缺口"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-584E2600"
msgid ""
"Straight to diagonal Tram-on-Street - junction to straight SAM cobblestone Street with Tram turning circle\n"
"Fill street gap with diagonal Station or puzzle pieces"
msgstr ""
